in combination with carboplatin and gemcitabine, in adult women with epithelial ovarian, fallopian tube or primary peritoneal cancer, in first relapse, platinum-sensitive, and who have not previously been treated with bevacizumab or other VEGF inhibitors or other agents targeting the VEGF receptor;
